 to continue to the previous view or stay in the current view.</p><p>Compatible components are:</p><ul><li><p><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Bottom sheets show secondary content anchored to the bottom of the screen.\" link-label=\"More on bottom sheets\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/bottom-sheets/overview\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Bottom sheet</app-froala-tooltip-element><br /></p></li><li><p><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Navigation bars let people switch between UI views on smaller devices.\" link-label=\"More on navigation bars\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/navigation-bar/overview\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Navigation bar</app-froala-tooltip-element><br /></p></li><li><p><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Navigation rails let people switch between UI views on mid-sized devices.\" link-label=\"More on navigation rails\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/navigation-rail/overview\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Navigation rail</app-froala-tooltip-element><br /></p></li><li><p><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"The search bar is a persistent and prominent search field at the top of the screen.\" link-label=\"More on search bars\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/search/overview\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Search bar</app-froala-tooltip-element><br /></p></li><li><p><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Side sheets show secondary content anchored to the side of the screen.\" link-label=\"More on side sheets\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/side-sheets/overview\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Side sheet</app-froala-tooltip-element><br /></p></li></ul>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,